      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighborhood’s roots trace back to railroads that built Deep Elm, giving the area its name and early industrial character.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.deepellumtexas.com/history/",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1991, artist Frank Campagna organized TunnelVisions, commissioning murals along the Good‑Latimer Expressway tunnel that still color the streets today.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
