      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Deep Ellum’s music scene attracted blues legends like Leadbelly and Blind Lemon Jefferson, who performed in local clubs during the 1920s recording boom.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deep_Ellum%2C_Dallas",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The former Dallas Landmark building was converted into loft apartments in 1997, preserving its historic façade while adding modern living space.",
